    26	
    27	- **Paper preprint link:** [https://mdipenta.github.io/files/ICSE24_funcExperiment.pdf](https://mdipenta.github.io/files/ICSE24_funcExperiment.pdf)
    28	- **Artifacts:** [https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8191782](https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8191782)
    29	
    30	### Data
    31	Results have been obtained by conducting the controlled experiment involving [Prolific](https://www.prolific.com) workers as participants. Data collection and processing followed a protocol approved by the University ethical board. Note that all data enclosed in the artifact is completely anonymized and does not contain sensible information.
    32	
    33	Further details about the provided dataset can be found in the Section [Results' directory and files](#results)
    34	
    35	
    36	### Setup and Usage (for executable artifacts): 
